---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="最新消息｜志連精緻搬家｜台中搬家推薦" description="志連精緻搬家的最新動態、搬家知識分享與優惠活動資訊。">
  <section class="pt-32 pb-16" style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, #023E7D 0%, #001845 100%);">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-white">最新消息</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg" style="color: #E0E7FF;">搬家知識、優惠活動與公司動態</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-24" style="background: #FFFBF5;">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <article class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #FFE8CC; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,18,51,0.06);">
          <div class="h-48 flex items-center justify-center" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #023E7D 0%, #0353A4 100%);"><span class="text-white/60 text-sm">文章封面</span></div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <span class="text-xs font-medium" style="color: #2EC4B6;">搬家知識</span>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold" style="color: #001233;">搬家前必做的5件事</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm" style="color: #64748B;">搬家前做好準備，讓搬遷過程更加順利。本文分享搬家前必須完成的5項重要準備工作...</p>
            <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-xs" style="color: #94A3B8;">2024-12-15</span>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #FFE8CC; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,18,51,0.06);">
          <div class="h-48 flex items-center justify-center" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0353A4 0%, #2EC4B6 100%);"><span class="text-white/60 text-sm">文章封面</span></div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <span class="text-xs font-medium" style="color: #2EC4B6;">公司動態</span>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold" style="color: #001233;">志連搬家新增吊車服務</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm" style="color: #64748B;">為滿足高樓層與特殊環境搬運需求，志連搬家正式新增專業吊車搬家服務...</p>
            <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-xs" style="color: #94A3B8;">2024-11-20</span>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #FFE8CC; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,18,51,0.06);">
          <div class="h-48 flex items-center justify-center" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2EC4B6 0%, #023E7D 100%);"><span class="text-white/60 text-sm">文章封面</span></div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <span class="text-xs font-medium" style="color: #2EC4B6;">優惠活動</span>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold" style="color: #001233;">年終搬家優惠開跑</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm" style="color: #64748B;">年底前預約搬家享專屬優惠，精緻搬家服務讓您輕鬆迎接新生活...</p>
            <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-xs" style="color: #94A3B8;">2024-10-05</span>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
